  - name: MQ Channel Down - IRESS
    detail: There is a status other than OK/Running on IRESS MQ Channel
    calendar: OfficeHours
    fluxfile: flux/mqchan_iress_stat.flux
    severity: 1
    threshold: 0
    comparison: gt
    tags: 
      - host
      - _field
      - _measurement
    interval: 300
    target: xapi
    action: | 
              Log in to the MQ server and check the channel status. Verify that the remote MQ server is reachable on the MQ port.
              Attempt to reset any unhealthy channel(s). User netstat (or ss) to check for any connections in an unusual state.
              If there is an underlying network problem escalate to Azure Network Support and the client. The remote MQ server
              is on TCP port 17516 on IP 208.77.94.31
